e remains group, skin maybe keep memo. We'll just set members and draft.\\n\\nPeople: one entry p1 Rex.\\n\\nMessages first batch: date, then messages 1-8 (Rex, Rex, 阿哲, Rex, Rex, 阿哲, 阿哲 image, Rex). That's 9 messages? Actually we can do up to 8. Let's include up to message 8.\\n\\nList them:\\n\\n1: Rex left side at 1:02 text \\\"幫幫幫幫幫！！\\\"\\n2: Rex left side same time? Actually both at 1:02. Should we include same time? It's okay.\\n\\n3: Rex \\\"你今天經過巨城對吧～\\\" 1:02? Actually script says same time 1:02. So maybe same.\\n\\nBut order: 1 Rex \\\"幫幫幫幫幫！！\\\" 1:02\\n2 Rex \\\"你今天經過巨城對吧～\\\" 1:02\\n3 阿哲 right \\\"對啊 怎樣\\\" 1:03\\n4 Rex left \\\"BEAMS聯名今天開賣！！我同事說早上排超長～\\\" 1:03\\n5 Rex left \\\"幫我看還有沒有🥺！！\\\" 1:03\\n6 阿哲 right \\\"等一下 我看看\\\" 1:05\\n7 阿哲 right image \\\"BEAMS店門口，人龍只剩三、四人在排隊\\\" 1:08\\n8 Rex left \\\"還有！！幫我排幫我排～～\\\" 1:08\\n\\nThat's 8 messages after date. Good.\\n\\nNow later batches: continue messages 9-... up to 40, plus skip after 13 etc.\\n\\nLet's prepare second batch with messages 9-16 maybe.\\n\\n9: Rex left \\\"我要黑色那款！BEAMS x Porter 雙肩包！！\\\" 1:09\\n10: 阿哲 right \\\"好 我排\\\" 1:09\\n11: 阿哲 right \\\"人不多 應該快到\\\" 1:10\\n12: Rex left \\\"啊啊啊你是神🙏🙏！！\\\" 1:10\\n13: Rex left \\\"等等我找官網圖傳你～\\\" 1:10\\n14: skip \\\"⋯⋯(略)⋯⋯\\\" (no time)\\n15: Rex left image (official webpage) 1:32\\n16: Rex left \\\"就這個！黑色的！！\\\" 1:32\\n17: 阿哲 right quote (Rex text) 1:34\\n18: 阿哲 right \\\"你剛說雙肩包\\\" 1:34\\n19: Rex left \\\"我知道～反正就黑色那個！！\\\" 1:34\\n20: 阿哲 right \\\"你說的雙肩包\\\" 1:35\\n21: Rex left \\\"？？\\\" 1:35\\n22: 阿哲 right \\\"你傳的截圖是側背包\\\" 1:35\\n23: 阿哲 right \\\"到底要哪個\\\" 1:36\\n24: Rex left \\\"……\\\" 1:37\\n25: Rex left \\\"等一下我想一下～\\\" 1:37\\n26: Rex left \\\"那雙肩包還有沒有！！\\\" 1:38\\n27: 阿哲 right image (展示櫃) 1:40\\n28: 阿哲 right \\\"雙肩包剛被買走\\\" 1:40\\n29: Rex left sticker (崩潰) 1:41\\n30: Rex left \\\"不要！！！！！\\\" 1:41\\n31: Rex left \\\"你怎麼不早點問我🥲🥲🥲～\\\" 1:41\\n32: 阿哲 right \\\"我問了啊\\\" 1:42\\n33: 阿哲 right \\\"你傳錯截圖給我\\\" 1:42\\n34: Rex left \\\"那側背呢！！\\\" 1:43\\n35: 阿哲 right \\\"側背還有\\\" 1:43\\n36: Rex left \\\"那我要側背！！快幫我搶！！\\\" 1:43\\n37: 阿哲 right image (店員遞出側背包) 1:45\\n38: 阿哲 right \\\"買好了\\\" 1:45\\n39: Rex left \\\"6800？！\\\" 1:46\\n40: Rex left \\\"官網不是寫18700嗎～\\\" 1:46\\n\\nAlso need to include read status for right messages? Only need for side:\\\"right\\\" maybe add read on the last message? The script didn't indicate read. Not required. Could omit.\\n\\nNow apply_script with initial batch, then append second batch.\\n\\nLet's do calls.\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"fc_09a3151f-2896-4299-97aa-3df5468fa652\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"apply_script\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"messages\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"8月9日 (五)\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"date\\\"},{\\\"personId\\\":\\\"p1\\\",\\\"side\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"幫幫幫幫幫！！\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"下午1:02\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\"},{\\\"personId\\\":\\\"p1\\\",\\\"side\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"你今天經過巨城對吧～\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"下午1:02\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\"},{\\\"side\\\":\\\"right\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"對啊 怎樣\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"下午1:03\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\"},{\\\"personId\\\":\\\"p1\\\",\\\"side\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"BEAMS聯名今天開賣！！我同事說早上排超長～\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"下午1:03\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\"},{\\\"personId\\\":\\\"p1\\\",\\\"side\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"幫我看還有沒有🥺！！\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"下午1:03\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\"},{\\\"side\\\":\\\"right\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"等一下 我看看\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"下午1:05\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\"},{\\\"imgDesc\\\":\\\"BEAMS店門口，人龍只剩三、四人在排隊\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"image\\\",\\\"side\\\":\\\"right\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"下午1:08\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\"},{\\\"personId\\\":\\\"p1\\\",\\\"side\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"還有！！幫我排幫我排～～\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"下午1:08\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\"}],\\\"people\\\":[{\\\"avatar\\\":null,\\\"id\\\":\\\"p1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Rex\\\"}],\\\"settings\\\":{\\\"draft\\\":\\\"那是日幣 你到底要不要啦\\\",\\\"members\\\":2}}\"}}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_cal