].id 的 personId。\\\"}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"自審清單,逐項檢查剛才的修改:\\n1) 使用者任務與你補齊的規格是否完整達成?劇情有起因、轉折、收尾?\\n2) 每個人物口氣前後一致、像真人?\\n3) 時間格式照「下午4:06」慣例且合理遞增?\\n4) 節奏有留白?(日期分隔、(略)、已讀不回的時間差)\\n5) 有善用視覺敘事?(貼圖、引用回覆、表情回應、draft)\\n6) settings.draft 若有值,那句話是「自己」要說的嗎?若是左側角色的台詞,改成一般訊息或清空 draft\\n7) settings 的 title/mode 與內容相符?\\n先用 get_script 重讀一次腳本核對;有任何不合格就立刻用工具修正,全部合格才用一句話回報完成。\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"reasoning\":\"We need to check why a message dropped: likely one missing type field. Let's inspect which. The dropped hint indicates one message missing type. Look at our messages: All have type defined. But maybe the quote message missing text field? It has type \\\"msg\\\". It's okay. However maybe we omitted \\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\" for quote? We did include type. Check each: All have type. Maybe one missing side? All have side. Check sticker: we have kind:\\\"sticker\\\", but also need type:\\\"msg\\\". We included type. Good.\\n\\nBut maybe one message missing personId for left side? For left side messages we must include personId. Indeed many left side messages we omitted personId, e.g., after quote we have left messages: \\\"我知道～...\\\" we gave personId? Yes we gave personId. However later left messages after 24 we have left messages with personId omitted: e.g., \\\"等一下我想一下～\\\" is left, we gave personId? Yes we gave personId for those? Let's check: we wrote {\\\"personId\\\":\\\"p1\\\",\\\"side\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"等一下我想一下～\\\"...}. Yes.\\n\\nCheck \\\"那雙肩包還有沒有！！\\\": we gave personId. Good.\\n\\nCheck \\\"不要！！！！！\\\": we gave personId. Yes.\\n\\nCheck \\\"你怎麼不早點問我...\\\": we gave personId. Yes.\\n\\nCheck \\\"那側背呢！！\\\": we gave personId. Yes.\\n\\nCheck \\\"那我要側背！！快幫我搶！！\\\": we gave personId. Yes.\\n\\nCheck \\\"6800？！\\\" and \\\"官網不是寫18700嗎～\\\": personId present. Yes.\\n\\nMaybe missing type for one of the image messages: we have image messages with type:\\\"msg\\\". Good.\\n\\nMaybe missing side for image? We have side defined.\\n\\nMaybe missing personId for left image? There's no left image besides the first image (right). The later images are right side. So okay.\\n\\nWhich message missing type? Let's count messages: we have 40 messages expected. The dropped hint indicates 1 dropped. Possibly the quote message missing \\\"text\\\" field but that's optional. However maybe the system expects \\\"text\\\" field even if empty. Might be required for msg type. The spec says text is optional? In schema, text is optional. But earlier hint said missing type, not missing text. Hmm.\\n\\nMaybe we missed \\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\" for one of the messages inadvertently. Let's scan quickly: All entries have \\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\" except the date and skip. The quote message has \\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\". Good.\\n\\nMaybe we omitted \\\"kind\\\" for some image but that is fine.\\n\\nMaybe the sticker message: we gave kind:\\\"sticker\\\", but also need \\\"text\\\"? Not needed. Should be okay.\\n\\nMaybe we omitted \\\"personId\\\" for the sticker left? We gave personId. Yes.\\n\\nLet's retrieve script again to see which message is missing fields.\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"fc_aa2dc7ae-0880-4be5-86eb-a9491ba99525\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"get_script\",\"arguments\":\"{}\"}}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"fc_aa2dc7ae-0880-4be5-86eb-a9491ba99525\",\"name\":\"get_script\",\"content\":\"{\\\"settings\\\":{\\\"title\\\":\\\"新對話\\\",\\\"members\\\":2,\\\"bg\\\":\\\"#7d9bc1\\\",\\\"bgImage\\\":null,\\\"font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"sysColor\\\":\\\"#2d3b4e\\\",\\\"theme\\\":\\\"light\\\",\\\"skin\\\":\\\"memo\\\",\\\"playfulness\\\":0.5,\\\"aiFab\\\":true,\\\"frameLevel\\\":\\\"phone\\\",\\\"notch\\\":\\\"island\\\",\\\"radius\\\":32,\\\"buttons\\\":true,\\\"homebar\\\":true,\\\"watermark\\\":true,\\\"wmText\\\":\\\"LINE 對話製造機\\\",\\\"clock\\\":\\\"16:08\\\",\\\"signal\\\":4,\\\"wifi\\\":true,\\\"battery\\\":87,\\\"battText\\\":true,\\\"sbAlarm\\\":true,\\\"sbArrows\\\":true,\\\"sbVolte\\\":true,\\