ssing personId for left image? There's no left image besides the first image (right). The later images are right side. So okay.\\n\\nWhich message missing type? Let's count messages: we have 40 messages expected. The dropped hint indicates 1 dropped. Possibly the quote message missing \\\"text\\\" field but that's optional. However maybe the system expects \\\"text\\\" field even if empty. Might be required for msg type. The spec says text is optional? In schema, text is optional. But earlier hint said missing type, not missing text. Hmm.\\n\\nMaybe we missed \\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\" for one of the messages inadvertently. Let's scan quickly: All entries have \\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\" except the date and skip. The quote message has \\\"type\\\":\\\"msg\\\". Good.\\n\\nMaybe we omitted \\\"kind\\\" for some image but that is fine.\\n\\nMaybe the sticker message: we gave kind:\\\"sticker\\\", but also need \\\"text\\\"? Not needed. Should be okay.\\n\\nMaybe we omitted \\\"personId\\\" for the sticker left? We gave personId. Yes.\\n\\nLet's retrieve script again to see which message is missing fields.\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"fc_aa2dc7ae-0880-4be5-86eb-a9491ba99525\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"get_script\",\"arguments\":\"{}\"}}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"fc_aa2dc7ae-0880-4be5-86eb-a9491ba99525\",\"name\":\"get_script\",\"content\":\"{\\\"settings\\\":{\\\"title\\\":\\\"新對話\\\",\\\"members\\\":2,\\\"bg\\\":\\\"#7d9bc1\\\",\\\"bgImage\\\":null,\\\"font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"sysColor\\\":\\\"#2d3b4e\\\",\\\"theme\\\":\\\"light\\\",\\\"skin\\\":\\\"memo\\\",\\\"playfulness\\\":0.5,\\\"aiFab\\\":true,\\\"frameLevel\\\":\\\"phone\\\",\\\"notch\\\":\\\"island\\\",\\\"radius\\\":32,\\\"buttons\\\":true,\\\"homebar\\\":true,\\\"watermark\\\":true,\\\"wmText\\\":\\\"LINE 對話製造機\\\",\\\"clock\\\":\\\"16:08\\\",\\\"signal\\\":4,\\\"wifi\\\":true,\\\"battery\\\":87,\\\"battText\\\":true,\\\"sbAlarm\\\":true,\\\"sbArrows\\\":true,\\\"sbVolte\\\":true,\\